  "releaseNotes": "- High-Efficiency Serialization: Enhanced collection formatters to support complex types like Dictionary entries with minimal allocation.\n- Zero-Allocation Discovery: New PacketRegistry APIs supporting in-place deserialization (Deserialize ref) for optimized object pooling.\n- Secure Environment Management: Hardened filesystem sanitization and Unix-compatible directory permission helpers for robust cross-platform reliability.\n- Reliable Orchestration: Optimized TaskManager and Identity subsystems for predictable performance in high-concurrency environments.",
